{"v":1,"id":"e4ad7996b008","synced":true,"offset":0,"source":"suno","lines":[{"t":"I came to you with servant hands,","s":10.37,"e":16.14},{"t":"no sword upon My side.","s":16.25,"e":21.74},{"t":"I wore the weight you couldn’t lift,","s":21.86,"e":26.77},{"t":"I let My innocence be tried.","s":26.89,"e":33.07},{"t":"A thorny crown left these marks...","s":33.19,"e":38.99},{"t":"They pierced hand and feet.","s":39.04,"e":44.36},{"t":"This was not weakness, child...","s":44.44,"e":49.71},{"t":"I gave all for My sheep.","s":49.79,"e":55.65},{"t":"Do not mistake the quiet","s":55.67,"e":60.96},{"t":"for a heart that does not burn.","s":61.04,"e":67.26},{"t":"Mercy called in gentle whispers","s":67.34,"e":72.13},{"t":"so the world could finally learn.","s":72.25,"e":78.88},{"t":"I am the same One.","s":78.91,"e":83.35},{"t":"That banked wrath into a cup.","s":83.39,"e":88.54},{"t":"The hand that healed and holds you","s":88.6,"e":93.75},{"t":"will pour wrath out when time is up.","s":93.83,"e":100.25},{"t":"I can not shift My nature","s":100.37,"e":105.48},{"t":"My eyes burn with Holy flame.","s":105.6,"e":112.06},{"t":"I am the same One.","s":112.18,"e":116.53},{"t":"I will always remain.","s":116.65,"e":122.36},{"t":"I did not come confused or late,","s":122.39,"e":127.98},{"t":"nor unaware of men.","s":128.06,"e":133.72},{"t":"I knew the cost of waiting long,","s":133.8,"e":139.11},{"t":"I knew what terries then.","s":139.23,"e":144.77},{"t":"The Lamb who stood before you","s":144.81,"e":150.0},{"t":"was never blind to wrong…","s":150.11,"e":155.7},{"t":"I chose to bear it silently","s":155.82,"e":161.41},{"t":"until the time was gone.","s":161.49,"e":166.79},{"t":"Compassion held the hour,","s":166.8,"e":172.56},{"t":"patience stayed My hand…","s":172.62,"e":177.79},{"t":"But justice was not sleeping,","s":177.89,"e":183.05},{"t":"only waiting to stand.","s":183.14,"e":189.53},{"t":"I am the same One.","s":189.55,"e":194.01},{"t":"That banked wrath into a cup.","s":194.06,"e":199.19},{"t":"The One that heals and holds you","s":199.23,"e":204.34},{"t":"will pour out wrath when time is up.","s":204.41,"e":210.84},{"t":"I can not shift My nature","s":210.96,"e":215.9},{"t":"My eyes burn with Holy flame.","s":216.02,"e":222.69},{"t":"I am the same One.","s":222.77,"e":227.03},{"t":"I will always remain.","s":227.15,"e":232.78},{"t":"To show love by suffering,","s":232.79,"e":238.28},{"t":"I chose the longest road.","s":238.4,"e":243.75},{"t":"To heal wounds by waiting,","s":243.83,"e":249.22},{"t":"I carried every load.","s":249.34,"e":254.58},{"t":"But a love without passion","s":254.64,"e":259.55},{"t":"will not rise and guard the pure…","s":259.63,"e":266.41},{"t":"So My justice carried out,","s":266.49,"e":270.9},{"t":"is evil's final cure","s":271.01,"e":276.88},{"t":"I am the same One.","s":276.9,"e":281.22},{"t":"That banked wrath into a cup.","s":281.27,"e":286.42},{"t":"The One that heals and holds you","s":286.48,"e":291.54},{"t":"will pour out wrath when time is up.","s":291.6,"e":297.55},{"t":"Do not fear the hour coming..","s":297.66,"e":303.03},{"t":"Dread mistaking Who I AM","s":303.11,"e":309.34},{"t":"I am the same One, child.","s":309.49,"e":314.24},{"t":"I always have been.","s":314.36,"e":320.48},{"t":"Stay close.","s":320.51,"e":325.33},{"t":"I will help you see...","s":325.45,"e":331.01},{"t":"To understand what comes,","s":331.1,"e":336.7},{"t":"Seek to know Me.","s":336.78,"e":338.22}],"match":null}
